@startuml brukerhistorie5Sekvensdiagram
hide footbox

title Brukerhistorie 5 - Se, endre og slette egne anmeldelser

actor "Student" as User
box "JavaFX-klient" #F1EFE8
participant "MyReviewsController\n(ui)" as MyC
participant "EditReviewController\n(ui)" as EditC
participant "ReviewService\n(core)" as ClientService
participant "RemoteReviewRepository\n(ui)" as Remote
end box
box "REST-server" #FAECE7
participant "UserController /\nOwnReviewController (rest)" as RestC
participant "AuthenticationService\n(rest)" as Auth
participant "ReviewService\n(core)" as ServerService
participant "ReviewHandler\n(file)" as Handler
database "courses.json" as File
end box

== Se egne anmeldelser ==

User -> MyC : trykker «MINE ANMELDELSER»
MyC -> ClientService : findReviewsByOwner(email)\n(i bakgrunnen)
ClientService -> Remote : findReviewsByOwner(email)
Remote -> RestC : GET /api/me/reviews\nAuthorization: Bearer <token>
RestC -> Auth : requireEmail(authorization)
Auth --> RestC : e-posten til brukeren
note right of RestC : E-posten kommer fra tokenet,\nså man får bare sine egne\nanmeldelser, også de anonyme
RestC -> ServerService : findReviewsByOwner(email)
ServerService -> Handler : findAllCourses()
Handler -> File : leser filen
Handler --> ServerService : alle emnene
ServerService -> ServerService : beholder bare anmeldelsene\nder ownerEmail er brukeren
note right of ServerService : default-metoden\nReviewRepository.findReviewsByOwner
ServerService --> RestC : List<Course>
RestC --> Remote : 200 OK + liste med OwnReviewResponse
Remote --> MyC : List<Course> (via ReviewService)
MyC --> User : ett kort per anmeldelse\nmed «ENDRE ✎» og «SLETT»

== Endre en anmeldelse ==

User -> MyC : trykker «ENDRE ✎»
MyC -> EditC : showEditReview(...) via Navigation\nskjemaet fylles med anmeldelsen
User -> EditC : endrer stjerner, kommentar eller\nanonymitet og trykker «ENDRE ✎»
EditC -> ClientService : updateReview(original, rating,\ncomment, anonymous) (i bakgrunnen)
ClientService -> Remote : updateReview(id, rating,\ncomment, anonymous)
Remote -> RestC : PUT /api/reviews/{id}\nAuthorization: Bearer <token>\n{rating, comment, anonymous}
RestC -> Auth : requireEmail(authorization)
RestC -> ServerService : updateReview(id, email,\nrating, comment, anonymous)
ServerService -> ServerService : requireOwnReview(id, email)

alt anmeldelsen tilhører en annen
    ServerService --> RestC : kaster NotReviewOwnerException
    RestC --> Remote : 403 Forbidden
    Remote --> EditC : NotReviewOwnerException
    EditC --> User : viser feilmelding
else egen anmeldelse
    ServerService -> Handler : updateReview(id, rating,\ncomment, anonymous)
    Handler -> File : endrer anmeldelsen\nunder skrivelås
    RestC --> Remote : 200 OK + ReviewResponse
    Remote --> EditC : Review (via ReviewService)
    EditC -> MyC : showMyReviews(saveButton)
    MyC --> User : listen med den\nendrede anmeldelsen
end

== Slette en anmeldelse ==

User -> MyC : trykker «SLETT»
MyC --> User : «Vil du slette anmeldelsen av ...?»
User -> MyC : trykker OK
MyC -> ClientService : deleteReview(review)\n(i bakgrunnen)
ClientService -> Remote : deleteReview(id)
Remote -> RestC : DELETE /api/reviews/{id}\nAuthorization: Bearer <token>
RestC -> Auth : requireEmail(authorization)
RestC -> ServerService : deleteReview(id, email)
ServerService -> ServerService : requireOwnReview(id, email)
ServerService -> Handler : deleteReview(id)
Handler -> File : fjerner anmeldelsen\nunder skrivelås
RestC --> Remote : 204 No Content
Remote --> ClientService : true
ClientService --> MyC : ferdig
MyC --> User : fjerner kortet og viser\n«Anmeldelsen ble slettet.»

note over Remote, RestC
  404 betyr at anmeldelsen allerede er slettet. Da viser appen
  «Anmeldelsen finnes ikke lenger.» og fjerner kortet.
  Uten gyldig token svarer serveren 401.
end note

@enduml